---
title: Relic rating V2
---

Relic ratings now combine continuous character main stat preferences, substat percentiles and set integrity. Head and hands use substats alone, with explicit sphere and rope exemptions for selected characters. Explanations show suitability, enhancement completion, contributions and effective occurrences. Panel targets and breakpoints have been removed. Incomplete builds retain valid piece ratings, and panel calculation failures do not prevent readable relics from being rated.
